# ailock blocklist — domains sinkholed while the proxy is down.
#
# One bare domain per line (no scheme, no wildcard: hosts files support
# neither, so subdomains must be listed explicitly). [section] headers are
# organizational only. '#' comments and blank lines are ignored.
# Changes take effect on the next toggle or service restart.
#
# On OpenWrt (dnsmasq_conf_dir configured) every entry also becomes a
# wildcard address=/domain/ rule, covering all subdomains for the LAN.

